        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Parent as Parent (User)\n    participant Frontend as Frontend (App/Web)\n    participant Backend as Backend API (FastAPI)\n    participant DB as Database (PostgreSQL)\n    participant Verifier as Password Hash Verifier\n\n    Parent-&gt;&gt;Frontend: Enter email and password\n    Frontend-&gt;&gt;Backend: POST /api/auth/login (email, password)\n    Backend-&gt;&gt;DB: Find parent by email\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Backend: Return parent record or no account found\n\n    alt Account exists and password is correct\n        Backend-&gt;&gt;Verifier: Verify submitted password against stored hash\n        Verifier--&gt;&gt;Backend: Password valid\n        Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 200 OK (Access Token + Parent Info)\n        Frontend--&gt;&gt;Parent: Show dashboard / Parent Mode\n\n    else Account exists but password is incorrect\n        Backend-&gt;&gt;Verifier: Verify submitted password against stored hash\n        Verifier--&gt;&gt;Backend: Password invalid\n        Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 401 Unauthorized (Invalid email or password)\n        Frontend--&gt;&gt;Parent: Show error; offer Try Again and Forgot Password\n\n    else No account found\n        Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 401 Unauthorized (Invalid email or password)\n        Frontend--&gt;&gt;Parent: Show error; offer Sign-up link\n    end\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="0dJPue0Pk6SHRgGWCIpo-1">
